# Optional: a SECOND Web3Forms access key used only for visit notifications.
# Keeping visit pings on their own key means they can't use up the monthly
# quota that real contact-form messages need.
#
# Create one at https://web3forms.com (same email), then copy this file to
# `.env` and fill it in. If unset, visit pings fall back to the contact-form key.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_VISIT_KEY=
